---
import RelatedLinks from '../components/RelatedLinks.astro';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { AMAZON_DISCLOSURE } from '../data/affiliates';
---
<Base title="Affiliate Disclosure | ReadyGearHub" description="How ReadyGearHub earns money: affiliate links, featured listings, and how we keep recommendations honest, in line with FTC guidelines.">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="wrap"><h1>Affiliate Disclosure</h1><p class="fine light">Last updated November 15, 2026</p></div></section>
  <section class="wrap section prose">
    <p><strong>The short version:</strong> ReadyGearHub may earn money when you click some links on this site and make a purchase. This doesn't cost you anything extra.</p>
    <h2>Affiliate links</h2>
    <p>Some of the links on ReadyGearHub are affiliate links. If you click one and buy something, we may receive a commission from the retailer or brand. The price you pay is the same either way. Links that are affiliate links are marked with <code>rel="sponsored"</code> in the page code, and pages that may contain affiliate links show a short disclosure near those links.</p>
    <p>We may participate in affiliate programs run by individual brands and by affiliate networks. Program participation doesn't change which products we list or how we describe them.</p>
    <h2>Amazon</h2>
    <p>ReadyGearHub is a participant in the Amazon Services LLC Associates Program, an affiliate advertising program designed to provide a means for sites to earn advertising fees by advertising and linking to Amazon.com. <strong>{AMAZON_DISCLOSURE}</strong> Amazon links on this site carry our Associates tracking ID, and we never show an Amazon price, rating or review on a card, because those change constantly. Check the Amazon page for the current price.</p>
    <h2>Our own digital products</h2>
    <p>ReadyGearHub previously sold a few print-at-home PDF guides through Payhip. Those offers are no longer for sale. If you already bought one, checkout and delivery were handled by Payhip, not by an affiliate program, and the <a href="/refund-policy/">refund policy</a> still applies to that purchase.</p>
    <h2>Featured listings</h2>
    <p>In the future, businesses may be able to pay for a <strong>Featured</strong> placement. Any paid placement will be clearly labeled "Featured." "Trending" labels are based on seasonal demand and timeliness, not payment.</p>
    <h2>What we don't do</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>We don't publish fake reviews, star ratings, or testimonials.</li>
      <li>We don't claim to have personally tested products unless we say so on the page.</li>
      <li>When a gear listing or card shows a price, it is what the maker or retailer listed on the date shown (for example “About $X · checked Nov 24, 2026 · may change”). Prices change constantly, so please check the retailer for the current price. With no dated price, we show no price.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>This disclosure is provided in accordance with the U.S. Federal Trade Commission's guidance on endorsements and testimonials (16 CFR Part 255).</p>
    <p>Questions? <a href="/contact/">Contact us</a>.</p>
  </section>
  <RelatedLinks links={[
    { href: "/about/", icon: "ℹ️", title: "About ReadyGearHub", text: "How we choose listings and stay independent." },
    { href: "/gear/", icon: "📚", title: "Gear directory", text: "Hand-picked gear sorted into simple lanes." },
    { href: "/guides/", icon: "📘", title: "Guides & checklists", text: "Plain-English prep guides for storms, outages, and water." },
    { href: "/privacy/", icon: "🔒", title: "Privacy policy", text: "What we collect and your choices." },
    { href: "/contact/", icon: "💬", title: "Contact us", text: "Questions, corrections, or product suggestions." },
    { href: "/get-featured/", icon: "⭐", title: "Get featured", text: "List your business in the directory." }
  ]} />
</Base>
